02:12:12,570 --> 02:12:13,620
Right?

2532
02:12:13,620 --> 02:12:17,040
So these are those cats.

2533
02:12:17,040 --> 02:12:18,540
And we can click any of them.

2534
02:12:18,540 --> 02:12:20,190
I don't know,
Pixel, for example.

