2563
02:13:38,850 --> 02:13:40,470
to her Majesty's Treasury.

2564
02:13:40,470 --> 02:13:42,750
His employer is Her
Majesty's Treasury.

2565
02:13:42,750 --> 02:13:44,290
He's a male creature.

2566
02:13:44,290 --> 02:13:46,650
And Wikidata knows
that this cat is

2567
02:13:46,650 --> 02:13:53,127
named after William Gladstone,
