the label to queue

3528
03:00:39,610 --> 03:00:43,900
100, which is Boston big
city in the United States.

3529
03:00:43,900 --> 03:00:45,500
And that is incorrect, right?

3530
03:00:45,500 --> 03:00:48,910
That's kind of naive computer
